{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love rock? Do you want to become a legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>RockDog</strong> \u2014 a musical RPG where your guitar skills decide everything! Fight rivals, repeat their riffs, dodge attacks, and make choices that will change your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore countless locations, meet unique characters, and dive into a story full of friendship, mysteries, and betrayal. But remember: nothing is as simple as it seems\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. You are not the main character in this story\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music-based combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many side quests and locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters with their own stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices affect the ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every villain is truly a villain</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008700?t=1759409959","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008700/8a85665105603d93009adcebb7414f92ddb51159/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759409959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008700/7a15e8286b6188ab6699d981908132daddc5fc68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759409959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008700/7a15e8286b6188ab6699d981908132daddc5fc68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759409959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4050540,"description":"